flowchart TB
  accTitle: Reproduction wrapper success and failure gates
  accDescr: Invalid inputs exit nonzero. A required training or parity child failure also exits nonzero. Success is reported only after required children succeed and expected fresh artifacts are present.
  I["Inputs valid?"] -->|"yes"| R["Run required tiny training + parity"]
  I -->|"no"| F["Useful error; nonzero exit"]
  R --> G["Run passed?"]
  G -->|"no"| F
  G -->|"yes"| S["Write success summary; exit zero"]
